+# Bounded GDS1 native qualification plan
+
+Historical pre-launch plan. The later allocation and executed results are in
+[QUALIFICATION.md](QUALIFICATION.md).
+
+Status at plan freeze: prepared, not launched. Cache owner explicitly released lane 2. The
+coordinator has not allocated storage for this plan. No compile, test harness,
+world run, new target, full checkout or deletion occurred while preparing it.
+
+## Binding and reusable artifacts
+
+- GDS runtime/tests: `2a36370f6734f31d8637f8931dacff0e8e6efbea`.
+- Qualified FULL baseline: `2f2cd592ef7a05d199dd1bc3353afdd7f49bcee7`.
+- Existing worktree: `grouped-m2-decoder-credit-v1`; no new checkout.
+- Compiler: recovered official Rust 1.99.1, edition 2021.
+- Reuse the 14 exact external libraries in `NATIVE-BINDING.json`, from
+  `recovery-sleep-durable-target-v3/debug/deps`. Their bytes/hashes were checked.
+  Five local dependency source trees (core, world, GPU backend, runtime, storage)
+  are identical at fbf2a517, qualified FULL, GDS and the frozen active source.
+- Compile only the training root as a test harness. Do not link an existing
+  alife_training library, cache branch or meal-memory branch. No Cargo command,
+  dependency compilation or target modification is needed.
+- Root features: `cpu-backend`, `default`, `receipt-lineage`; no `gpu-tests`.
+  Flags: opt-level 0, debug info 0, debug assertions/overflow checks enabled,
+  embed-bitcode disabled, strip debug info, one codegen unit, no incremental.
+  Both old FULL and GDS use the exact same dependencies and flags. This is dev0
+  dependency qualification, not the earlier optimized Cargo test profile.
+- Use the cache owner's recorded `compile-v4.command.json` as a command template,
+  replacing only the root input/output/cwd and CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR with this
+  worktree's selected source. Reverify every dependency hash immediately before
+  compiling. Do not copy the cache source overlay or infer cache acceptance.
+
+## Serial sequence after resource allocation
+
+1. Record the approved filesystem floor and packet-growth cap, source/feature/
+   compiler/dependency hashes and a byte baseline. Run the existing read-only
+   legacy-source witness and formatting/diff checks. The qualified FULL wrapper
+   source and selected legacy bodies must still match their recorded hashes.
+2. Preserve the clean GDS branch. In the same worktree, create a separate
+   test-only branch from qualified FULL. Add only the identical
+   `grouped_full_literal_witness.rs` and its module declaration to the existing
+   decoder tests. Keep the qualified branch ref unchanged. Save the exact
+   test-only source commit and diff, not a whole source archive.
+3. Root-only compile the baseline test harness with the exact dev0 graph. Retain
+   its binary/hash. Run exactly the FULL witness below. No general baseline
+   suite or cohort is launched. Check space and actual output lengths.
+4. Return to the clean GDS source. Root-only compile its test harness with the
+   same flags/graph. Retain the binary/hash. Check space before each test. Run
+   exactly the four sham tests below, serially, then the identical FULL witness.
+5. Require all five FULL baseline/candidate output files to match byte for byte:
+   complete initial envelope, both acquired envelopes and both full decision
+   tuples. Preserve source and binary hashes, native results and mismatch/failure
+   evidence. Keep original qualified artifacts untouched.
+6. Report the result and remaining lint/compatibility limits. Full old-suite
+   reruns, strict lint, extra native diagnostics and any scientific comparison
+   are separate gates unless explicitly included in the renewed allocation.
+   The cache owner established ordinary rustc only, not direct strict Clippy;
+   no Clippy reuse or pass is inferred from that work.
+
+Proposed packet directory is
+`/workspace/shared/grouped-decoder-sham-qualification-v1`. Compiler output and TMPDIR both live inside that
+accounted packet, not a new Cargo target. Do not create it until allocation.
+Unset optional GDE1 evidence-export variables; only the two explicit witness
+runs export complete state, privately/local. No state export is published.
+
+## Exact native selection
+
+Test prefix:
+`cpu::host::grouped_host_envelope::tests::decoder::sham::`
+
+Run each of these once with `--exact --test-threads=1 --nocapture`:
+
+1. `grouped_sham_first_step_equal_work_and_only_fast_write_difference`
+   Two fresh 240-tick preparations, one FULL and one sham step at 0.73. Compare
+   sample/context/receptors/work/reservation/debit/sealed patch; check FULL
+   applied versus sham hypothetical counts and the narrow state difference.
+2. `grouped_sham_exact_cold_continuation_and_cross_mode_rejection`
+   Three fresh 240-tick preparations (sham, FULL, closed). Eight successful
+   steps total and one intentional NaN failure; same-mode cold continuation
+   uses 1.17, 0.73 and 1.37. Synthetic frozen sentinels are explicitly labeled.
+   Reject foreign prefixes, relabeled foreign controller metadata, and preserve
+   rollback bytes. No later FULL/sham trajectory equality is demanded.
+3. `grouped_sham_rejects_full_credit_wrong_provenance_and_reuse`
+   One fresh 240-tick preparation and one sham step. Subsequent wrong-mode,
+   corrupted-provenance and duplicate attempts use staged diagnostic copies;
+   they are not additional lived outcomes or world steps.
+4. `grouped_sham_nonzero_trace_survives_memory_sleep_and_waking`
+   One fresh 1,200-tick preparation, at most 24 native intervals at 0.73. Require
+   actual sleep, acquired traces, exactly one memory consolidation, cold restore,
+   waking and resumed decisions; all fast/generation values stay fixed. An
+   absent event is a failed declared bound, not permission to force or search.
+
+FULL witness selector, once on each source:
+`cpu::host::grouped_host_envelope::tests::decoder::full_literal_witness::grouped_full_literal_witness`
+
+Run with `--exact --ignored --test-threads=1 --nocapture` and separate explicit
+`ALIFE_GROUPED_FULL_WITNESS_DIR` destinations. Witness source SHA-256:
+`4b9cecd40964f677f47a131d316b313b8b322ce20d204d9cf80fe67c1bb0a943`.
+Each run uses one fresh 240-tick preparation and exactly two FULL steps at 0.73
+and 1.17, with complete native cold restore after each.
+
+Total bound across these six selected test executions: eight 240-tick and one
+1,200-tick preparations (3,120 ordinary preparation ticks), at most 40 native
+step attempts, including one intentional failed step. At most 39 complete steps;
+sleep-only intervals may produce no decision. All use the existing GRPHOST seed
+`0x03475250484F5354`, never the primary scientific seed. No broad suite, seed
+sweep or action/reward/coefficient override is included.
+
+## Footprint and stop conditions
+
+The closest measured root-only dev0 test binary is 84,989,816 bytes. The old
