+- Planned peak: 310. Requested cap: 320 (335,544,320 bytes).
+
+Expected retained output is roughly 180–215 MiB, but allocation uses the peak,
+not that expectation. Reuse external libraries read-only; do not count hardlinks
+as freeing disk. No deletion, replacement of qualified binaries or extra archive
