+Sham history is still unobserved and the projection is not a guarantee. The
+recommended action is to wait for Full's terminal measurement (then expected
+in about 28 minutes) and reconcile again. No allocation or launch is implied.
+
+The coordinator explicitly agreed to this deferral after reviewing the snapshot.
+Remain on hold until a new resource allocation, even though lane 2 is free.
